1521
01:05:43.780 --> 01:05:45.540
Is it cheaper than a new mattress?

1522
01:05:45.940 --> 01:05:51.500
Could you imagine you have someone coming to your house, you know, every two weeks for

1523
01:05:51.500 --> 01:05:55.760
