1524
01:05:55.920 --> 01:05:55.980
No.

1525
01:05:55.980 --> 01:05:57.080
What does that smell like?

1526
01:05:57.240 --> 01:05:57.540
No.

1527
01:05:57.920 --> 01:05:58.820
I don't want it.

1528
