1532
01:06:06.740 --> 01:06:08.280
I don't want to think about it.

1533
01:06:08.440 --> 01:06:11.280
I was happy before we started talking about it.

1534
01:06:11.380 --> 01:06:11.620
No, I'm itchy.

1535
01:06:11.680 --> 01:06:12.540
I was fine.

1536
01:06:12.860 --> 01:06:13.400
I know.

1537
01:06:13.520 --> 01:06:14.060
I'm sorry.

1538
01:06:14.300 --> 01:06:15.880
But I found that fascinating.

1539
01:06:16.040 --> 01:06:17.040
Stacy, I loved that.

1540
01:06:17.160 --> 01:06:17.740
I ate it up.

1541
01:06:17.860 --> 01:06:18.220
Yes.

1542
01:06:18.220 --> 01:06:21.860
Thank you, Stacy, for all of that information that's going to haunt me.

1543
01:06:22.440 --> 01:06:27.220
Well, Gabe is spraying something into Packer's beer.

1544
01:06:27.920 --> 01:06:28.800
His inhaler.

1545
01:06:28.960 --> 01:06:29.280
Yeah.

1546
01:06:29.280 --> 01:06:30.660
I looked it up in the script.

1547
01:06:30.660 --> 01:06:32.320
