1548
01:06:32.480 --> 01:06:37.460
In the shooting draft, it said, Gabe takes out his inhaler and starts repeatedly pumping

1549
01:06:37.460 --> 01:06:38.640
it into Packer's drink.

1550
01:06:38.920 --> 01:06:43.020
Gabe gets winded and takes a hit of it, then goes back to emptying it into the drink.

1551
01:06:43.200 --> 01:06:44.480
Oh, we didn't see that part.

1552
01:06:45.440 --> 01:06:48.100
Well, it works because Packer is going to vomit.

1553
01:06:48.220 --> 01:06:51.840
And to Gabe's lap, ruining his bootleg corduroys.

1554
01:06:52.320 --> 01:06:54.160
We got a piece of fan mail from John T.

1555
01:06:54.280 --> 01:06:56.020
in Hull, UK, who said,

1556
01:06:56.240 --> 01:06:59.960
One of the lines that has always tickled me is when Gabe says,

