01:07:00.700 --> 01:07:03.140
They don't make these cords in bootcut anymore.

1558
01:07:03.800 --> 01:07:07.060
I laugh every time I rewatch the series, which is a lot,

1559
01:07:07.160 --> 01:07:10.240
and I would love it if you could do a deep dive on bootleg cords.

1560
01:07:10.620 --> 01:07:11.580
John, I'm with you.

1561
01:07:11.680 --> 01:07:12.460
It cracked me up.

1562
01:07:12.580 --> 01:07:16.200
What I also really loved was the camera work where they panned down.

1563
01:07:16.920 --> 01:07:19.380
You know, Zach Woods is very tall.

1564
01:07:19.380 --> 01:07:23.100
So those are some really long cords, but they were bootleg.

1565
01:07:23.800 --> 01:07:26.900
I'll have you know, John, I looked it up for you.

1566
01:07:27.260 --> 01:07:30.300
You can get men's bootcut cords.

1567
01:07:30.520 --> 01:07:34.560
In fact, they were labeled as being back in style.

1568
01:07:35.180 --> 01:07:41.040
You can find them at Walmart for $36.99, and they come in a variety of colors.

1569
01:07:41.420 --> 01:07:47.980
You can get black, coffee, khaki, wine red, or cream white.

1570
01:07:48.280 --> 01:07:49.880
Give them to me in cream white.

1571
01:07:50.280 --> 01:07:51.040
I'm just kidding.

1572
01:07:51.240 --> 01:07:51.560
I'm kidding.

1573
01:07:51.740 --> 01:07:55.960
I saw the picture of just these white bootcut cords, and I wondered,

1574
01:07:55.960 --> 01:07:58.940
