1575
01:07:59.120 --> 01:07:59.440
Mm-hmm.

1576
01:08:00.120 --> 01:08:01.140
But yes, they're available.

1577
01:08:01.720 --> 01:08:06.360
Speaking of Tala Nasty, somebody's going to get hashtag Tala Nasty'd.

1578
01:08:06.820 --> 01:08:08.240
